Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Makefile: drop -rc6 so the release is 7.3.0-sl7

Ubuntu 7.3.0-9.9 is built from 7.3-rc6 but versioned 7.3.0; the ItsLucas CI
also builds with EXTRAVERSION= for the same reason.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 3a3290973..1c51f31d4 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 VERSION = 7
 PATCHLEVEL = 3
 SUBLEVEL = 0
-EXTRAVERSION = -rc6
+EXTRAVERSION =
 NAME = Baby Opossum Posse
 
